# 🔐 Backend Authentication System

A simple and secure backend application implementing **JWT Authentication** and **Role-Based Access Control** using Node.js, Express, and MongoDB.

---

## 🚀 Features

* User Registration with role selection (Admin, Teacher, Student)
* Secure Login using JWT (JSON Web Token)
* Password hashing using bcrypt
* Protected routes using middleware
* Role-based access control (RBAC)
* Clean and modular folder structure

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB (Mongoose)
* JWT (jsonwebtoken)
* bcryptjs

