## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

1. Clone the repository

   ```
   git clone <your-repo-link>
   ```

2. Install dependencies

   ```
   npm install
   ```

3. Create `.env` file

   ```
   PORT=5000
   MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_url
   JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
   ```

4. Run the server

   ```
   npx nodemon server.js
   ```

